  "description": "1.5.1\n      - Carbon.Common version update\n      1.5.0\n      - Dotnet 8.0 target framework added, older versions removed\n      1.4.0\n      - Carbon.Serilog added and Serilog.Enrichers.Sensitive Enricher added for masking sensitive values within logs.\n      1.3.3\n      - Carbon.Common updated and IQueryable OrderBy extension method bug fixed\n      1.3.2\n      - Carbon.Common updated and nested ordering achieved\n      1.3.1\n      - Minor code refactorings, typos\n      1.3.0\n      - Multiple Consul Support Added, File Config support added for Kubernetes Apps\n      1.2.0\n      - Serilog.Sinks.ElasticSearch package removed.Reason =&gt; ElasticSearch.Net Dependency problem for 7.x update of ElasticSearch.\n          note : add if your app uses ElasticSearch for logging",
